# Android: NEVER uninstall — only in-place update

This is a hard ban. Violating it destroys user data.

Mechanical enforcement: Cursor `beforeShellExecution` hooks deny `flutter install`, `adb uninstall`, and `pm uninstall` (`failClosed: true`). Do not try to bypass them.

## Forbidden (unless the user explicitly says uninstall/delete/remove the app in THIS message)

- `adb uninstall`
- `pm uninstall` / `cmd package uninstall`
- **`flutter install`** — it uninstalls the old app first. NEVER use it.
- Any script or flow that removes the package before installing

## Required install / update path

1. `flutter build apk` or `flutter build apk --debug`
2. `adb -s <serial> install -r path/to.apk`
3. Signature mismatch → STOP and ask. Never uninstall to “fix” it.

## Scope

All projects, all devices. “Install” / “update” never means uninstall.
